# PC card team-lead (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 18, TMODE-31, BENCH-145): arm ld (TMODE-31 LEAD forced on; the named teams play it on top of their entry) on the nine leader and droid teams of plans/team-lead-set.txt, 16 seeds from 6100, against master (the aa build). Template: lgprep writes work/team-lead-ld.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
6100
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-lead-set.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@ld.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@ld
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-lead-@V@-ld
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-lead-ld.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
